// Title: Encrypt Aspose.Cells Workbook as TIFF and Upload via FTPS (TLS) in C#
// Description: Creates a workbook, saves it as a TIFF image in a MemoryStream, encrypts the image with AES‑256 CBC (PKCS7), and uploads the encrypted bytes to an FTPS server using FtpWebRequest with TLS enabled.
// Keywords: Aspose.Cells | C# TIFF encryption | AES‑256 CBC | FTPS upload | TLS FTP | Workbook to image | Encrypted file transfer | FtpWebRequest | Secure file upload | MemoryStream
// Common Searches: C# encrypt TIFF generated by Aspose.Cells and send over FTPS | How to upload encrypted workbook image to FTPS with TLS | Save Aspose.Cells workbook as TIFF in memory then encrypt | Upload binary data to FTPS using FtpWebRequest C# | AES encryption of spreadsheet image before FTP transfer
// Developer Intent: Generate a TIFF image from a workbook, encrypt the image with AES‑256, and transfer the encrypted file to an FTPS server using TLS.
